### Audio ###
# Voice-comparison scratch output. The shipped clips in public/audio/ ARE
# committed — they are the app's audio, not build artifacts.
audio-samples/
### Deploy ###
# The upload bundle, rebuilt by zipping dist/ - not source.
nakeeyat-upload.zip

# Built APK copied to the project root for convenience.
*.apk

# The Xcode handoff bundle, rebuilt by archiving the source - not source itself.
nakeeyat-ios-xcode.zip

### iOS ###
# Xcode's own build products and per-user state live under ios/, which carries
# its own .gitignore from the Capacitor template. Only the shipped archive is
# ignored here, matching the APK rule above.
*.ipa
